<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;color:#374151;">
  Dear {{officerName}},
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  A new complaint has been assigned to you for investigation:
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px;text-align:center;">
  <span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;letter-spacing:1px;">
    {{ticketCode}}
  </span>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;"><strong>Subject:</strong> {{subject}}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;"><strong>Priority:</strong> {{priority}}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;"><strong>Department:</strong> {{departmentName}}</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Please log in to your dashboard to review and begin investigating this complaint.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px;text-align:center;">
  <a href="{{queueUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;">
    View My Queue
  </a>
</p>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;">
  This is an automated notification. Please do not reply to this email.
</p>
